---

The extension unit protocol implemented here — the GUID, the control selectors,
the 8-byte payloads and the two-step field-of-view sequence — was reverse
engineered from Razer Synapse 3 USB captures by the cameractrls project:

  Copyright (c) 2022 Gergo Koteles <soyer@irl.hu>
  https://github.com/soyersoyer/cameractrls  (MIT License)
  https://github.com/soyersoyer/kiyoproctrls (MIT License)

No code was copied from those projects; the transport here is an independent
IOKit implementation. The notice is preserved because the protocol constants
are their work.
